==Battleground==
*15 [[Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 18.67~23.33 seconds<sup>560f~700f</sup>.
*15 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 18.67~23.33 seconds<sup>560f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Futenyan (Enemy)|Futenyan]] spawns.
**3 [[Futenyan (Enemy)|Futenyans]] spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

